[00:09.16] Day and night I worry over you
[00:16.10] I'm payin' now for bein' so untrue
[00:25.02] I pray each night although it seems in vain
[00:33.22] I know I'll never win your love again
[00:40.38] I won your love for such a precious jewel
[00:49.52] You pleaded dear and yet I was so cruel
[00:57.88] A love so rare cannot be bound and chained
[01:05.88] I know I'll never win your love again
[01:13.34] [ Steel ]
[01:48.30] I try so hard to change what cannot be
[01:55.98] And yet how weak my efforts seem to me
[02:04.86] In fate's cruel hands forever I'll remain
[02:13.14] I know I'll never win your love again
[02:20.30] Within my heart there'll always be a chill
[02:29.78] Until at last it's beating shall be still
[02:37.76] My weary soul will find it's journey's end
[02:46.30] I know I'll never win your love again
